{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_540ba59c06c8b213f82a74893bba6f3b845dc479f45a6dff28e32ea533cb1b8c"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: governance is single-maintainer; architecture changes and public API/SDK changes require opening an issue first, and CODEOWNERS prevents self-merging of PRs touching IP-sensitive paths."}],"claim_ids":["clm_540ba59c06c8b213f82a74893bba6f3b845dc479f45a6dff28e32ea533cb1b8c"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T02:32:49Z","created_by_operation":"op_7ee34c06088e4f39a222392b77393db3","id":"pg_1ceee4fa30375651bcb7630f2d20c97f","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/proxysoul-empryo-governance-md-f771fc238e64-630f2d20c97f.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_2d8994836b3c5d2b8d9090f19017de77"],"title":"proxysoul/Empryo/GOVERNANCE.md @ f771fc238e64","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:32:49Z","updated_by_operation":"op_7ee34c06088e4f39a222392b77393db3"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_11b155fae820130f6b2e57ed1cff76ebe9979c2126b04a30ad99827e1b97982b"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Three surfaces share one code graph: a native desktop app, a full terminal UI, and a headless CLI for scripts and CI."},{"claim_ids":["clm_1ea081c8d8f82949a172903bc4b5b471f3eff431a7c530630f335d28997d2ceb"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The README reports head-to-head benchmarks against pi on bug-fixing tasks (e.g. 8/9 vs 7/9 bugs fixed, 28% lower cost, 57% faster), with methodology and a reproduction repo at proxysoul/pi-vs-empryo-bench."},{"claim_ids":["clm_21b796a4bf6d31a5ce6e41b8ee98702675533a89284c8c96e62cb6aea1cf082c"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Empryo builds codebase understanding before mutating code: on launch, tree-sitter parses the repo into a live graph of symbols, imports, and call sites ranked by PageRank and git co-change."},{"claim_ids":["clm_61a3f5fdf3ef12024c7679ea81d7e75b70628f52267a52f7c64c0a252618a4fa"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The agent supports 22 LLM providers including Anthropic, OpenAI, Google, Groq, DeepSeek, and Bedrock, plus OpenAI-compatible endpoints and fully local Ollama/LM Studio; an llmgateway provider ships built in."},{"claim_ids":["clm_93b032eebe4dc60c8a58ea9bd5727dd46e4cdf57e03e718bcba44e8326b77175"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Every prompt creates a git checkpoint ('time machine'), letting users rewind code and conversation together to any turn."},{"claim_ids":["clm_d782d826851893b948b1e0bdd2a9f31d84714013714695bd66b66957966293a7"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The product offers 65+ symbol-level AST editing operations with atomic all-or-nothing rollback and structural edits across 30+ languages, with a typecheck as the gate."},{"claim_ids":["clm_e8e585d9f5405bcd4ce7afe08b501f314913f8a68cbb7687cd53fa5ef4e4f0f1"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A task router assigns models to ten routable roles (e.g. spark for read-only scouting, ember for code edits, verify for review), configurable per tab, per project, or globally, with custom agents definable."}],"claim_ids":["clm_11b155fae820130f6b2e57ed1cff76ebe9979c2126b04a30ad99827e1b97982b","clm_1ea081c8d8f82949a172903bc4b5b471f3eff431a7c530630f335d28997d2ceb","clm_21b796a4bf6d31a5ce6e41b8ee98702675533a89284c8c96e62cb6aea1cf082c","clm_61a3f5fdf3ef12024c7679ea81d7e75b70628f52267a52f7c64c0a252618a4fa","clm_93b032eebe4dc60c8a58ea9bd5727dd46e4cdf57e03e718bcba44e8326b77175","clm_d782d826851893b948b1e0bdd2a9f31d84714013714695bd66b66957966293a7","clm_e8e585d9f5405bcd4ce7afe08b501f314913f8a68cbb7687cd53fa5ef4e4f0f1"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T02:32:49Z","created_by_operation":"op_7ee34c06088e4f39a222392b77393db3","id":"pg_3f4727c7407d5854a3ab62d04c68fb30","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/proxysoul-empryo-readme-md-f771fc238e64-62d04c68fb30.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_8a57cf60df025ae5a1deb672ab8df8b1"],"title":"proxysoul/Empryo/README.md @ f771fc238e64","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:32:49Z","updated_by_operation":"op_7ee34c06088e4f39a222392b77393db3"}
